<title>USA: IPO PRICING- Brookdale prices at $11.50.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING- Brookdale prices at $11.50.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Brookdale Living Communities Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At				    $11.50</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	   $11.50 - $12.50</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			4,500,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter Friedman Billings Ramsey &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The estimated price range for the planned initial public offering in Brookdale Living Communities Inc was lowered to $11.50 to $12.50 from $12.50 to $13.50. The original estimated price range was $15 to $17.</p>
<p>The proposed number of shares for the planned initial public offering was lowered to 4.5 million shares from five million shares. Initially, 6.25 million shares were proposed.</p>
</text>
